<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS1" title="In Appendix D Relation between Integration-Based and Optimization-Based Sampling ‣ Equilibrium Matching: Generative Modeling with Implicit Energy-Based Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.1 </span>ODE Sampling as a Special Case of Optimization</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS2" title="In Appendix D Relation between Integration-Based and Optimization-Based Sampling ‣ Equilibrium Matching: Generative Modeling with Implicit Energy-Based Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2 </span>General Integration Samplers</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
